<title>NORWAY: Fokus says no sale of BNbank stake to DnB.</title>
<headline>Fokus says no sale of BNbank stake to DnB.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fokus Bank, Norway's fourth largest bank, said on Friday it would not sell its 10 percent stake in mortgage lender BNbank to rival bidder Den norske Bank (DnB).</p>
<p>Fokus and DnB are currently locked in a takeover battle for Trondheim-based BNbank. DnB said on Friday it had received acceptance from 82 percent of BNbank shareholders to its bid.</p>
</text>
